      "message": "fix(examples): refresh the guide-multiaxis cached toolpath to the #3080 behaviour\n\nThe Indexed Face1 cache in examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj kept the\npre-#3080 FirstTraverseLow warning in the local frame of the tilted\nplane (height_mm 10.0, top_mm 11.114, tilted false). The file was\nregenerated through its own headless path (open_project, generate of\nIndexed Face1, save_project), so the cache now holds the warning in the\nuser frame: height_mm 30.0, top_mm 31.114, tilted true. The raise is\nthe same 1.114 mm. The Swarf1 cache is untouched.\n\nPinned by guide_projects::indexed_guide_preserves_legacy_basis_and_path\nand guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths.\n\nFixes #3234",
